{"route":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs/monographs-under-preparation/8-category-en/1202-monographs-for-ip-2026","kind":"article","crumbs":[{"label":"Products & Services"},{"label":"Indian Pharmacopoeia (IP)","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia"},{"label":"Stakeholder Comments","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs"},{"label":"Draft New General Chapter / Monographs - For Comments","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs/monographs-under-preparation"},{"label":"Chemical Monographs"}],"updated":"2026-08-17","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs/monographs-under-preparation/8-category-en/1202-monographs-for-ip-2026.html","title":"Chemical Monographs","bodyHtml":"<p>For Public Review and Comments. Stakeholder's may provide comments within 45 days of upload of the monographs to <a href=\"mailto:lab.ipc@gov.in\"></a><a href=\"mailto:lab.ipc@gov.in\">lab.ipc@gov.in</a>.<br><br></p>\n<p>1. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/1.-Carmellose-API.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Carmellose<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/2.-Corn-Starch.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Corn Starch<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/3.-Doxycycline-for-injection.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Doxycycline for Injection<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/4.-Doxycycline-API.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Doxycycline<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/5.-Eltrombopag-Olamine.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Eltrombopag Olamine<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/6.-Eltrombopag-Olamine-tablets.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Eltrombopag Olamine Tablets<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/7.-Fluconazole-in-Dextrose-Injection.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fluconazole in Dextrose Injection<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/8.-Halothane.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Halothane<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/9.-Mesalazine-Gastro-resistant-Tablets.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mesalazine Gastro-resistant Tablets<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>10. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/10.-Metformin-and-Sitagliptin-Tablets.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sitagliptin and Metformin Tablets<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>11. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/11.-Methylene-Chloride.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Methylene Chloride<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>12. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/ARnD/12.-Nicard